<title>POLAND: POLIFARB-C AUG NET RISES TO PLN 3.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>POLIFARB-C AUG NET RISES TO PLN 3.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.09 vs   1.59</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 5.14 vs   3.13</p>
<p> Operating profit     5.83 vs   3.85</p>
<p> Sales		   31.86 vs  27.25</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	    15.13 vs  13.24</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	28.11 vs  21.87</p>
<p> Operating profit    29.96 vs  21.77</p>
<p> Sales		  214.10 vs 177.17</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish paint maker is Polifarb Cieszym</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
